A file with an :INCLUDE whose closure cannot be resolved (no workspace
index under --validate) is not checked for undeclared names: the unread
script may declare them (diag.undeclared_variable, D10, issue #304).
aShelfCodes would otherwise flag.
-- input.ssl --
:INCLUDE Inventory.ShelfCodes;
:PROCEDURE ShelfLabel;
	:PARAMETERS nSlot;
	:DECLARE sLabel;
	sLabel := aShelfCodes[nSlot];
	:RETURN sLabel;
:ENDPROC;
-- format --
:INCLUDE Inventory.ShelfCodes;

:PROCEDURE ShelfLabel;
	:PARAMETERS nSlot;
	:DECLARE sLabel;
	sLabel := aShelfCodes[nSlot];
	:RETURN sLabel;
:ENDPROC;
-- diagnostics --
-- diagnostics [--strict --info] --
